{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick a Hero\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from an ensemble of characters who each have their own unique backstory and playstyles.\u00a0 Pick from the chaotic Archaeologist or the brave Folk Hero initially, but additional content updates will bring at least six new characters and new factions to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/74b26b27c5df2fe19c23ce3b4912eb20.avif?t=1755218881\" width=500 height=212 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Haven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day - whether you lived or died in your previous excursions - you find yourself summoned magically back to Haven, where a mysterious monolith stands.\u00a0 An old man named Pan protects it, but he seems friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/458f572f61d9e0d0d6f1ccf1de6117e0.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/458f572f61d9e0d0d6f1ccf1de6117e0.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/458f572f61d9e0d0d6f1ccf1de6117e0.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Venture Forth &amp; Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forest itself shifts and changes over time, as if by a malign will of its own.\u00a0 Use trailheads to travel between clearings in the Forest, but be careful - there\u2019s no way of knowing what dangers might lie in wait for you ahead!\u00a0\u00a0The forest\u2019s inhabitants have not taken kindly to your intrusion.\u00a0 You must fight them off if you intend to progress through the forest.\u00a0 But be warned - as time passes, the forest becomes more aware of your presence and will send more enemies to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/fb849b207dfa09bae97b1bdaea059450.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/fb849b207dfa09bae97b1bdaea059450.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/fb849b207dfa09bae97b1bdaea059450.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Action RTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Waking of Haven is a low-click RTS with action rogue-like elements.\u00a0 You play as a champion with a unique set of abilities, but ultimately you can only accomplish success by assembling a squad of troops to fight by your side.\u00a0 These troops can follow simple orders but be careful - they sometimes have a will of their own and will flee if they sense the tide of battle turning against them.\u00a0 This applies to enemies as well, so use that to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/f7ef5e94ce9f8d034af6dc7bdbf2d2ee.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/f7ef5e94ce9f8d034af6dc7bdbf2d2ee.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/f7ef5e94ce9f8d034af6dc7bdbf2d2ee.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day resets your strength and squad, allowing you to shape your next build in new and interesting ways depending on what you find in the Forest.\u00a0 Invest in Perk Points for your skills, level up your troops, equip them with armaments and acquire powerful artifacts to exploit the natural synergies between your skills, your forces and your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/8e735eeac626569a995bf27c0e38f244.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/8e735eeac626569a995bf27c0e38f244.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/8e735eeac626569a995bf27c0e38f244.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating your enemies, remember to look around for resources like wood or iron.\u00a0 These are instrumental in building defenses and upgrades that will make you more likely to succeed in future excursions.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/22d36b4635eadb24baa1a145dd4ae92d.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/22d36b4635eadb24baa1a145dd4ae92d.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/22d36b4635eadb24baa1a145dd4ae92d.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teleport Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is costly.\u00a0 If you want to make it back to Haven with all your resources, you\u2019ll need to find one of many teleportation stones scattered throughout the Forest.\u00a0 Be warned: doing so will alert your enemies to your presence.\u00a0 Prepare for a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/3d311ecb3978248884779acb06f90763.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/3d311ecb3978248884779acb06f90763.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/3d311ecb3978248884779acb06f90763.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the Mysteries of the Sowers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually you will stumble upon locations which just might reveal the deep, dark secrets of the ancient gods known as \u201cSowers.\u201d\u00a0 They each seem to leave behind traces of their essence in the form of six distinct resources.\u00a0 Consider using these resources to gain powerful abilities that can significantly enhance your playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918390?t=1755218881","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/fa91df9c1ee6a5280a011f3db504f07a1ecfbcbd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755218881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/c6867994e8897fbcfdfbeff70dab856d87372ba5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755218881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/c6867994e8897fbcfdfbeff70dab856d87372ba5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755218881","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The player can fight and kill enemies, sometimes with a cartoonish \"bleed\" effect."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick a Hero\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from an ensemble of characters who each have their own unique backstory and playstyles.\u00a0 Pick from the chaotic Archaeologist or the brave Folk Hero initially, but additional content updates will bring at least six new characters and new factions to play with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/74b26b27c5df2fe19c23ce3b4912eb20.avif?t=1755218881\" width=500 height=212 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Haven</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day - whether you lived or died in your previous excursions - you find yourself summoned magically back to Haven, where a mysterious monolith stands.\u00a0 An old man named Pan protects it, but he seems friendly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/458f572f61d9e0d0d6f1ccf1de6117e0.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/458f572f61d9e0d0d6f1cc