the tide of battle turning against them.\u00a0 This applies to enemies as well, so use that to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/f7ef5e94ce9f8d034af6dc7bdbf2d2ee.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/f7ef5e94ce9f8d034af6dc7bdbf2d2ee.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/f7ef5e94ce9f8d034af6dc7bdbf2d2ee.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day resets your strength and squad, allowing you to shape your next build in new and interesting ways depending on what you find in the Forest.\u00a0 Invest in Perk Points for your skills, level up your troops, equip them with armaments and acquire powerful artifacts to exploit the natural synergies between your skills, your forces and your items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/8e735eeac626569a995bf27c0e38f244.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/8e735eeac626569a995bf27c0e38f244.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/8e735eeac626569a995bf27c0e38f244.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After defeating your enemies, remember to look around for resources like wood or iron.\u00a0 These are instrumental in building defenses and upgrades that will make you more likely to succeed in future excursions.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/22d36b4635eadb24baa1a145dd4ae92d.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/22d36b4635eadb24baa1a145dd4ae92d.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/22d36b4635eadb24baa1a145dd4ae92d.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teleport Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is costly.\u00a0 If you want to make it back to Haven with all your resources, you\u2019ll need to find one of many teleportation stones scattered throughout the Forest.\u00a0 Be warned: doing so will alert your enemies to your presence.\u00a0 Prepare for a fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/3d311ecb3978248884779acb06f90763.poster.avif?t=1755218881\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/3d311ecb3978248884779acb06f90763.webm?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/extras/3d311ecb3978248884779acb06f90763.mp4?t=1755218881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the Mysteries of the Sowers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eventually you will stumble upon locations which just might reveal the deep, dark secrets of the ancient gods known as \u201cSowers.\u201d\u00a0 They each seem to leave behind traces of their essence in the form of six distinct resources.\u00a0 Consider using these resources to gain powerful abilities that can significantly enhance your playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Theogeny Games LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/5d618eb3808e09a365ea1584693dfe7b538127dd/header.jpg?t=1755218881","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"The Waking of Haven","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD A8-7600 / Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-3210<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 460 / NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 950 / Intel\u00ae Iris\u00ae Xe Graphics G7<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1 (build 19043) or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD A8-7600 / Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i3-3210<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon\u2122 RX 460 / NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 950 / Intel\u00ae Iris\u00ae Xe Graphics G7<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Theogeny Games LLC"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nNudez\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/f636ed8d05311cf21285dd92f5d183a086b3dba2/ss_f636ed8d05311cf21285dd92f5d183a086b3dba2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755218881","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/f636ed8d05311cf21285dd92f5d183a086b3dba2/ss_f636ed8d05311cf21285dd92f5d183a086b3dba2.600x338.jpg?t=1755218881"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/9f12b79321b78e367765f0944af6c5cfbd576d33/ss_9f12b79321b78e367765f0944af6c5cfbd576d33.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755218881","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/9f12b79321b78e367765f0944af6c5cfbd576d33/ss_9f12b79321b78e367765f0944af6c5cfbd576d33.600x338.jpg?t=1755218881"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/5afaa2bca5bc8f593195d6a03ca862bbaaf9aaa0/ss_5afaa2bca5bc8f593195d6a03ca862bbaaf9aaa0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755218881","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/5afaa2bca5bc8f593195d6a03ca862bbaaf9aaa0/ss_5afaa2bca5bc8f593195d6a03ca862bbaaf9aaa0.600x338.jpg?t=1755218881"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/ef9e0d96b3c9696f0279601b302446657e42dc02/ss_ef9e0d96b3c9696f0279601b302446657e42dc02.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755218881","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/ef9e0d96b3c9696f0279601b302446657e42dc02/ss_ef9e0d96b3c9696f0279601b302446657e42dc02.600x338.jpg?t=1755218881"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/97d5633e19118d8362e5e38e56ca1d59ac155737/ss_97d5633e19118d8362e5e38e56ca1d59ac155737.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755218881","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/97d5633e19118d8362e5e38e56ca1d59ac155737/ss_97d5633e19118d8362e5e38e56ca1d59ac155737.600x338.jpg?t=1755218881"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/d1483919d60567cada00038f73f5d2257c01f203/ss_d1483919d60567cada00038f73f5d2257c01f203.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755218881","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/d1483919d60567cada00038f73f5d2257c01f203/ss_d1483919d60567cada00038f73f5d2257c01f203.600x338.jpg?t=1755218881"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/7c7ea3916e5ce7803d54e8b3ece4d0b39751d12a/ss_7c7ea3916e5ce7803d54e8b3ece4d0b39751d12a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755218881","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/7c7ea3916e5ce7803d54e8b3ece4d0b39751d12a/ss_7c7ea3916e5ce7803d54e8b3ece4d0b39751d12a.600x338.jpg?t=1755218881"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/53121d0cae5a8e4c1e6ca80f7083218cf76257db/ss_53121d0cae5a8e4c1e6ca80f7083218cf76257db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755218881","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918390/53121d0cae5a8e4c1e6ca80f7083218cf76257db/ss_53121d0cae5a8e4c1e6ca80f7083218cf76257db.600x338.jpg?t=1755218881"}],"short_description":"The Waking of Haven is a low-click action RTS with rogue-lite elements. Assume control of a champion lost in an enchanted forest, accompanied by a squad of loyal troops. Find resources, level up, upgrade your forces and fight through the ever-shifting pathways of the forest \u2026 or die trying.","steam_appid":3918390,"support_info":{"email":"theogenygames@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}